6 | security-reviewer | SECURITY REVIEW of the PR on branch feat/ac-handover-identity. Read-only; tmp writes only. Record head SHA at start and at report. The change gates assistant-originated trip records behind identity and adds a copy endpoint. Check: no information about an assistant record reaches a guest or a non-owner beyond the status code; the 404 for an unknown id is byte-identical to the 404 for a record the caller may not see; the copy cannot be used to enumerate ids or to read another account by guessing; the copy never carries the assistant binding keys or anything tying it to the source owner; the clone route is rate limited; a revoked or expired token cannot copy; the web never stores the source id after the copy. Post ONE comment on issue 2340 whose first line reads SECURITY HANDOVER IDENTITY with a final SAFE or BLOCK line. HOUSE STYLE: no long dash, no AI tool or vendor name. | feat/ac-handover-identity
